      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neewór se'éngw bee/aangw ar sirbo/ nee ar sirdaa/aten nee ar da/atene gana tlabaá slaqamís ar tleéhh awa ta dahamiisi qoomár barta didá' hhoohhoó' wa gadiyuus. Inooín Aroni nguri tlabaá hhohhó' i hiriitiyé' ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura ádbáy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo naifeéra gari tleéhh ar sahaábu nee ar neewór se'éngw bee/aangw ar sirbo/, nee ar sirdaa/aten nee ar da/aten, nee ar neewór kitaánír hhohho' ar taa hhutla hhe'eés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sahaábu guna kwahhuút guri neewo tleéhh kuri tlaáq as kuwa alhiriiti nee neewór se'éngw bee/aangw ar sirbo/ nee ar sirdaa/aten nee ar da/aten nee ar kitaánír hhohho' ar taa hhutla hhe'eés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naifeéra kana tlina'aá tsár i tleéhh awa kar gawaá sum'i tsigiiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himú afeetlo kuna tleéhh nee heé gu baál, himuuwí kuna gawaá naifeéra i tleéhh kuwa tsegiiti baraá afeetlo. Himuuwí gár kura tleéhh a sahaábu nee neewór se'éngw bee/aangw ar sirbo/ nee ar sirdaa/aten nee ar da/aten nee ar kitaánír hhohho' ar taa hhuútl, ar taa tleéhh ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura ádbáy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo tlaa/aá ta bay sardoniíki kiri amohhe'eés, kiri qaás baraá qoloqoloó sahaábu, qoloqoláydá' adór kura tleéhh a adór laya as umér tlahh'aá mibaá nee tsár awa xoorór Israeli kawa gooin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós qoloqoláydá' guri qaás gawaá tlina'aá naifeéra as tawa adór xoorór Israeli kar inslaslay, ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura ádbáy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlakoó da/eewo kuri tleéhh nee heé gu baál tleehhamooro, ar adór naifeéra kara tleéhh. Gár ngura tleéhh a sahaábu nee neewór se'éngw bee/aangw ar sirbo/, nee ar sirdaa/aten, nee ar da/aten, nee kitaánír hhohho' ar taa hhuútl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlenaangós nee uroó bihheero i alqoná'. Tlakwaywí kuri waageeqáy, tlenaangós nee uroó bihheero aqo sentimiíta mibeeri tsár nee tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlakwaywí kuri qaalín ar hha'aá tsiyáhh awa tlaa/aá tlaxo uren. Hháw geera gár kura uhís a tlaa/aá ta bay akiíki nee awa topaási nee awa miislír daa/aat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hháw tsár kuna qaalín ar tlaa/aá ta bay sumariídi nee awa yakuútír sirboo/ nee awa miisli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hháw tám kuna qaalín ar tlaa/aá ta bay yasínto nee awa akiíkír daa/aat nee awa ta bay ametiísto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hháw tsiyáhh kuna qaalín ar tlaa/aá ta bay sambarajaádi nee awa shohaámu nee awa yáspi. Tlaa/eeká' sleémeero kina qamín baraá qoloqoloó sahaábu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe tlaa/aá mibaá nee tsár kiri tleéhh awa taa umér tlahh'aá xoorór Israeli i gooin. Tlaa/eedá' adór kira tleéhh a adór laya kar tlehhahhiti. Umuúqo tlaa/anowo umuú tlahhaay kuna gawaadií gooín, tlaa/ano iwa sihhmiiti daanduú tlahhaydá' wa aleeró. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo inooín himtawe ngina hhutliyé' ar sahaábuú hhohhó' as tlakwayduú da/eewo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoloqoloó tsár oo sahaábuú hhohhó' nguri tleehhiyé' nee duungoó tsár oo sahaábuú hhohhó'. Dungáywí kuri hiriít gawaá pasleemaá tsár awa tlakwaydá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himtaweedá' tsaraawo ar taa tleéhh ar sahaábu kari tseék gawaá dungáyduú tlakoó da/eewo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afér hatlá' ar himtaweedá' kari tseék gawaá qoloqoláydá' tsár, kari dinkwárí óh nee tsaafáydá' tsár oo geera oo naifeéra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duungoó tsár kuri tleéhh ar sahaábu, kuri hiriít gawaá tsaafoó baraay guruú tlakwáy wa ale bihhaá naifeéra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duungoó hatlá' tsár kuri tleéhh ar sahaábu, kuri qaás gawaá pasleemoodaá baraay awa geera awa naifeéra, didá' naifeéra nee himuú afeetlo ti doogiyé', himuudá' taa tleéhh nee heé gu baál tleehhamooro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlakwaydá' kuri tseék ar dungáydá' gawaá daanduú naifeéra, kuri tseék ar him'ér sirbo/, as kahhó' tlakwayduú da/eewo miwa slakwekwe'eét, ala masók iri gawaá daanduú naifeérárí kitaa hhe'ees. Adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura ádbáy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo hiyaay guri tleéhh ar neewór se'éngw bee/aangw ar sirbo/, oo ta dahaasi guruú naifeérár wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyaywí kuri ístí tleéhh, nee istadá' kari hhamaángwár harweér as iwa feehhitká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afaayér hiyaay kana qaalín ar slaqsa'aá mamaá komamaánga awa taa tleéhh ar neewór se'éngw bee/aangw ar taa hhuútl ar sirbo/ nee ar sirdaa/aten nee ar da/aten nee ar kitaánír hhohho' ar taa hhuútl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mitingiri ngiri tleehhiyé' ar sahaábuú hhohhó', kari qaás tla/ángw mamaá komamaángadá', afaayér hiyaay gana harwét. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe mitingiri alaá mamaá komamaánga tina wa qaás, tiri hhay neesliyé' afaayér hiyayduú gadiyeé kari adoorír harweér, ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura ádbáy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
