          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo hiyoó ququmaár kuri tleéhh ar kitaánír hhohho' as Aroni nee daaqaywós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Warqamoó ta ságwí tsegiiti kuri tleéhh ar kitaánír hhohho', nee kofyár kitaánír hhohho', nee suruwánoó kitaánír hhohhoe ar taa hhutliít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Him'ér afeetlo kari tleéhh ar kitaánír hhohho' ar taa hhutliít nee neewór se'éngw bee/aangw ar sirbo/ nee ar sirdaa/aten nee ar da/aten, kari qaalín ar adór hhoohhoo', ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura ádbáy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín slamángw hhoohhoó' kuri tleéhh, kuri parootuús ar sahaábuú hhohhó', nee /aymi'i kiri gawaadá' i gooín adór kuqaá laya awa kaahá', «Gaarí kaa paraátl as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slamangwdá' kuri tseék geera gawaá warqamoodá' ta ságwí tsegiiti ar himuú kaloó sirboó/, ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura ádbáy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe gadiyeé sleémeero ar heémár Mungú iri hhooeér, xoorór Israeli adoodá' sleémeero AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngwa báy kari tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo inooín heémadár Mungú kingiri huúw amór Mose nee xosluuwós sleémeero, nee dungáywose, nee nahhtose, nee muqslár afkú do' tsegit nee uheemiwose, nee yukumi'iiwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuuntukumaadá' taa tleéhh ar kadaá gwaandaawe nee kaduudá' natsaatsa'á', nee inqwaarír didá' hhoohhoo' gaa qasís, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee sandakmoó alqado, nee xaa'aá kur loohisi, nee kitangwduú gurtleemuwo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee meésa, nee xosluuwós sleémeero, nee mikaáteedár Munguhe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee kitángw tsaa'aso, nee tsaa'asorose, nee xosluuwós sleémeero dinkwa nee di/oó tsaa'asooro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee kitángw sahaábu, oo ilahhooa nee di/tá iimbalaxaango, nee mooyángw tsuua, nee inqwaarír afkú heémár Mungú, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee kitángw muqslír sirdaa/aat, nee muqslaadá' tsiiriihh ar sirdaa/aten, nee xaaiiwós kudaá loohiso, nee xosluuwós sleémeero, nee iimpér hamtlo, nee kitaangose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee inqwaruudá' tsiiriíhh taa tsegiít, kudá' taa afeenír ar tleehhi, nee uheemiiwós kudae, nee yukumi'iiwose, nee inqwaarír afkú afeenadá', nee tlin'iiwose, nee kika'aarose, nee xoslu sleémeero awa gadiyér koomá' baraá heémadár Munguhe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee tlabaadá' sleémeero taa tleéhh ar parooti as gadiyér didá' hhoohhoo', nee tlabaá hhohho' awa kaahamusmo Aroni, nee tlabaá daaqaywós as tawa kaahamuusér Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gadiyeérí sleémeero kana tleéhh nee xoorór Israeli ar adoodár kilá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura ádbáy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose gadiyeedaá inooín naa tleehhiyé' gina xuuxuú' ngina tleehhiyé' ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira oó'. Naagáy Mose inooín giri tsuúq.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.43"
            ]
          }
        }
